                                "sense_id": "f28904dd-c3ce-339d-842e-5056ea2ef1d0",
                                "text": "His conclusions are that (1) about the same quantity of anti-venene necessary to neutralise the venom in vitro is capable of doing so when the forner is injected into the bloodstream, and the latter sub-cutaneously ;"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0e5171bd-70c0-496a-8fee-e0039e660633",
                                "sense_id": "f28904dd-c3ce-339d-842e-5056ea2ef1d0",
                                "text": "What he really means is that the recommended use of anti-venene does not entirely agree with one set of medical opinion."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "234b61b0-6f0d-4f8b-910b-27aceef1cfe1",
                                "sense_id": "f28904dd-c3ce-339d-842e-5056ea2ef1d0",
                                "text": "Now it became necessary to take venom from captured Taipans, so as to produce anti-venene, and to put it in hospitals right through the danger areas."
